/// Whose WhatsApp Business Account a number lives under. Chosen per tenant.
///
/// PLATFORM — the number sits under Connect's own WABA. Nothing for the customer
/// to set up, Connect is billed by Meta and rebills. ⛔ The quality rating is
/// SHARED: ordinary recipients blocking ordinary compliant messages still drags
/// it down for every tenant on it. That is not something the send guard can
/// prevent, because no rule was broken.
///
/// OWN — the customer has their own WABA and their own rating, so a problem stays
/// theirs. Requires Tech Provider status, which requires business verification,
/// so this mode cannot be switched on until that exists.
enum WhatsAppHostingMode {
  PLATFORM
  OWN
}

